sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant A as Alice
    actor B as Bob
    participant S as 服务器
    A->>B: Hello Bob, how are you?
    B-->>A: Fine
    loop Every minute
        A->>S: Ping
        S--)A: Pong
    end
    alt is sick
        B->>B: Rest
    else is well
        B-xS: Work
    end
    Note right of S: 记录日志
    Note over A,B: A typical exchange
    opt Extra
      A<<->>S: sync
    end
